  "details": "1. Open the Main Menu\n\n2. Go to the Shop menu\n\n3. Scroll down to the \"New Accessories\" category and notice that Free product say \"Claimed\" if you have claimed them\n\n4. Click the Accessories tab\n\n5. Scroll down to the bottom\n\n6. Notice that the products in the \"Free\" category don't say \"Claimed\" even if you already claimed them\n\nThe same issue can be seen on paid products that you might have bought, it doesn't say \"Owned\" on the Accessories tab tab.",
